      "nearest_heading": "Definition",
      "prompt_text": "Graphing a Parametrically Defined Curve Sketch the curves described by the following parametric equations: $x (t) = t - 1 , y (t) = 2 t + 4 , \u22123 \\leq t \\leq 2$ $x (t) = t^{2} - 3 , y (t) = 2 t + 1 , \u22122 \\leq t \\leq 3$ $x (t) = 4 \\cos t , y (t) = 4 \\sin t , 0 \\leq t \\leq 2 \\pi$",
      "prompt_latex_bits": [
        "x (t) = t - 1 , y (t) = 2 t + 4 , \u22123 \\leq t \\leq 2",
        "x (t) = t^{2} - 3 , y (t) = 2 t + 1 , \u22122 \\leq t \\leq 3",
        "x (t) = 4 \\cos t , y (t) = 4 \\sin t , 0 \\leq t \\leq 2 \\pi"
      ],
      "has_solution": true,
      "source_anchor": "fs-id1169295362672",
      "notes": ""
